  "description_short": "Farm-fresh café 3km east of Plett serving honest breakfasts, artisan coffee, and homemade treats in a garden setting.",
  "description_long": "Tucked just off the N2 east of Plettenberg Bay, Nice Neighbour Café has become a beloved pit stop for locals and travellers alike. The relaxed farm-style setting feels worlds away from the highway rush, with outdoor seating under the trees and a warm, welcoming vibe that lives up to its name.\n\nThe menu leans into wholesome, farm-fresh ingredients — think generous breakfast plates, homemade bakes, and proper artisan coffee. Their pastries and treats are made in-house, and the deli stocks local produce and artisan goods worth browsing. It's the kind of place where you pop in for a quick coffee and end up staying for a proper meal.\n\nWhether you're breaking up a long drive or looking for a peaceful breakfast spot away from the Plett crowds, Nice Neighbour delivers honest food in a garden setting that feels like visiting a friend's farm kitchen.",
